# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/RiftMars.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Squirrel Rifts to Life on Mars connection.
# 
# 
# Survey conducted:	4/3/95.
# 
# Surveyed by:          Peter Bolt, Steven Roberts, Gavin Lowe
# 
# BCRA Survey Grade:	3
# 
# Data entry:		Ali Garman & Tim Long

# Name the survey section (identifier up to 12 characters)

survey riftmars

# Station Equivalences - describe tie-ins with other passages

# Prime Survey Stations (describe location of permanent marks)
# 
# Station 1 is station at top of climbs.
# Station 12 is life on mars, station on corner.

# Describe the units used and scale (if any).
# E.G. if measurements recorded in centimetres, *Units Length 0.01 metres

# Instrument Calibration - the correction is subtracted from the readings.
# Magnetic North (declination) to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at 9-Oct-94 in the Pwll Du area was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# 
# Describe the order of the survey data
# 

centreline
  # BCRA1
  sd length 1.0 metres
  sd compass clino 5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  1	2	3.9	-	down
  2	3	4.7	355	-25
  3	4	3.3	252	0
  4	5	4.2	156	30
  5	6	8.1	180	0
  6	7	2.6	184	-15
  7	8	3	-	up	# Up Rift
  8	9	7.9	320	0	# Pinches in too tight
  8	10	10	142	0
  10	11	8	50	0	# Goes to SR and HB1
  10	12	3.3	158	0	# Life on mars, station on corner (Squirrel2.29)

endcentreline
endsurvey
